                                "sense_id": "a1b670d1-9457-359a-bacc-1fb071b70acd",
                                "text": "And treated our fathers like scum, / Those uglisome messiahs that Bade us come, [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e81c6152-fa3b-400a-b212-5bd7939ef86d",
                                "sense_id": "a1b670d1-9457-359a-bacc-1fb071b70acd",
                                "text": "Devilish heads, five cubits in bigness from brow to chin, were carven in high relief along the five other walls: thirteen heads in all, very deformed and uglisome, laying out their tongues; and on the end of each tongue was stood a lamp brightly burning, and the eyes of the great faces were looking-glasses nicely cut up with facets to throw back the rays of the lamps, so that the whole banquet-room was lit with a brilliance of lamplight."
                            }
